            "title": "Is lanolin safe to use on skin?",
            "answer": "Yes, for most people. It has a long history of topical use, including in nursing and nipple-care products. A small percentage of people, often those with wool sensitivity, react to it. Patch test first if you have sensitive skin."
          }
        },
