          "settings": {
            "title": "Any allergy concerns?",
            "answer": "Two worth knowing about: lanolin (a small percentage of people, often wool-sensitive individuals, react to it) and tea tree oil (roughly 1-3% of people can develop contact sensitivity with repeated use). We recommend a patch test before your first full use. No tree nut or peanut oils in the formula; it does contain coconut oil, which some people with severe coconut allergies avoid."
          }
        },
